/S /H4
/T (A key pair is a secure way to access your virtual computer \(EC2 instance\) on AWS. It's like having a special key that only you can use to unlock your server. This ensures that no one else can access your virtual machine without your permission.)
/E (A key pair is a secure way to access your virtual computer \(EC2 instance\) on AWS. It's like having a special key that only you can use to unlock your server. This ensures that no one else can access your virtual machine without your permission.)
